=== Interpretation ===
  GSE145361 and GSE111629 are component samples of that meta-analysis and should show a clear positive correlation; 
  GSE87648 (inflammatory bowel disease) is unrelated and should be close to zero - it serves as the negative control here; 
  if it correlates as well, what agrees is technical structure rather than the effect of Parkinson's disease.

